<title>UK: Genfinance sets 2.0 billion Lux franc bond.</title>
<headline>Genfinance sets 2.0 billion Lux franc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by joint lead managers Banque Generale du Luxembourg and Generale</p>
<p>Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   GENFINANCE SA LUX</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  GENERALE BANK</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FLUX  COUPON   **5.0	 MATURITY    27.DEC.05</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  102.50    PAY DATE   L27.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 50-250    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    LUX	 HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES    **FOR FIRST FOUR YEARS, THEN 7.5 PCT</p>
<p>		L-LONG LAST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
